    "chunk_text": "\u00e6fde on \u00feone wag, \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Germanie gesohton Agustus ungeniedde him to fri\u00fee, & he him forgeaf \u00feone ni\u00f0 \u00fee \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m eall \u00feeos worold geceas Agustuses fri\u00f0 & his sibbe; & eallum monnum nanuht swa \u00dea wurdon Ianes dura f\u00e6ste betyned, & his loca rustega, swa hie n\u00e6fre \u00e6r n\u00e6ron. On \u00fe\u00e6m ilcan gere \u00fee \u00feis eall gewear\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s on \u00fe\u00e6m tw\u00e6m & feowerteo\u00fean wintra Nu ic h\u00e6bbe ges\u00e6d, cw\u00e6\u00f0 Orosius, from frym\u00fee \u00feisses middangeardes hu eall moncyn angeald Her enda\u00fe sio sixte boc, & ongin\u00f0 seo siofo\u00f0e..",
